"\n<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"hero\" id=\"top\" data-sc-act=\"flow\">\n  <nav class=\"nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\" aria-label=\"Ode home\">\n      <svg width=\"31\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 31 18\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M1 9c2-6 4 6 6 0s4-6 6 0 4 6 6 0 4-6 6 0 4 0 5 0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg>Ode\n    </a>\n    <div class=\"navlinks\">\n      <a href=\"#how\">How it works</a><button class=\"goal-link\" type=\"button\" data-open-goals=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-controls=\"goal-dialog\">Your space</button><a class=\"plans-link\" href=\"#plans\">Plans</a><a href=\"#privacy\">Your privacy</a><a class=\"therapist\" href=\"#therapists\">For therapists</a><a class=\"nav-cta\" href=\"#availability\">Launch updates</a>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n  <div class=\"hero-main\" id=\"main\">\n    <div class=\"hero-copy\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">A private place to reflect</div>\n      <h1>Say it as it is.<br><em>See what stays.</em></h1>\n      <p class=\"hero-lead\">Speak freely, or write when that feels easier. Ode reflects on what you share and helps you notice the patterns that matter to you.</p>\n      <div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button button-amber\" href=\"#waitlist\" data-open-waitlist=\"\">Join the waitlist <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#inside\">Follow a thought ↓</a></div>\n    </div>\n    <figure class=\"hero-art\" data-sc-parallax=\"-.25\">\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 145\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"ode-field-title ode-field-desc\">\n  <title id=\"ode-field-title\">Ode's Breath Line</title>\n  <desc id=\"ode-field-desc\">Speech gradually settles into a point of rest.</desc>\n  <g transform=\"translate(10 -10) scale(2.75)\">\n    <defs><clipPath id=\"ode-voice-reveal\" clipPathUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><rect class=\"art-reveal\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"184\" height=\"80\"></rect></clipPath></defs>\n    <path class=\"art-voice\" clip-path=\"url(#ode-voice-reveal)\" d=\"M 8 32 C 18 10, 28 54, 38 32 C 47 15, 56 49, 65 32 C 73 20, 81 44, 89 32 C 96 25, 103 39, 110 32 C 117 28.5, 124 35.5, 131 32 C 141 30, 153 34, 164 32\" stroke=\"#d8ad73\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"></path>\n    <circle class=\"art-dot\" cx=\"179\" cy=\"32\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#d8ad73\"></circle>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n<figcaption>a little clearer.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hero-foot\"><span>Speak or write. Reflect. Return to yourself.</span><span>iOS + Android · Store launch in preparation</span></div>\n</header>\n<main>\n  <section class=\"section intro\" id=\"how\" data-sc-act=\"flow\">\n    <div class=\"shell intro-grid\">\n      <div>\n        \n        <h2>Some thoughts need to be <em>spoken</em> before they make sense.</h2>\n        <p class=\"lead\">There is no perfect way to begin. Record or write what is on your mind; Ode turns it into a journal entry and a response grounded in what you shared.</p>\n        <div class=\"process\" aria-label=\"How Ode works\" data-sc-in=\"\" data-sc-stagger=\"65\">\n          <div class=\"process-row\"><b>Share</b><span>Record your thoughts, or write your journal in one message.</span></div>\n          <div class=\"process-row\"><b>Reflect</b><span>Read a grounded reflection, then follow up if you want.</span></div>\n          <div class=\"process-row\"><b>Notice</b><span>Over time, see moods and themes recur.</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sample-wrap\" data-sc-reveal=\"up\" data-sc-reveal-at=\"0.08 0.42\">\n        <button class=\"phone\" type=\"button\" data-open-screen=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-controls=\"screen-reader\" aria-label=\"Enlarge the Ode reflection screen\"><img src=\"/screenshots/approved/screen-1.jpg\" width=\"1080\" height=\"2400\" alt=\"Ode app reflection screen showing a sample journal entry and grounded response\"></button>\n        <span class=\"sample-label\">Current app screen · tap to enlarge and read</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <dialog class=\"goal-chooser\" id=\"goal-dialog\" data-welcome=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"goal-heading\" aria-describedby=\"goal-introduction\">\n    <button class=\"goal-close\" type=\"button\" data-close-goals=\"\" aria-label=\"Close goal chooser\">×</button>\n    <div class=\"shell goal-grid\">\n      <div class=\"goal-intro\">\n        <p class=\"section-kicker\">Welcome to Ode</p>\n        <h2 id=\"goal-heading\">What brings you <em>here?</em></h2>\n        <p id=\"goal-introduction\">Choose a starting point. This space takes on the same colours as your goal in the app. You can change it anytime.</p>\n        <p class=\"goal-current\">Showing the <strong id=\"goal-current-name\">Curious</strong> palette</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"goal-options\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Choose what brings you here\">\n          <button class=\"goal-option\" type=\"button\" data-goal=\"curious\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"goal-option-label\"><span class=\"goal-swatch\" style=\"--swatch:#c8955a\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Curious</span></button>\n          <button class=\"goal-option\" type=\"button\" data-goal=\"anxiety\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"goal-option-label\"><span class=\"goal-swatch\" style=\"--swatch:#7B9E87\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Anxiety</span></button>\n          <button class=\"goal-option\" type=\"button\" data-goal=\"stress\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"goal-option-label\"><span class=\"goal-swatch\" style=\"--swatch:#5B8DB8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Stress</span></button>\n          <button class=\"goal-option\" type=\"button\" data-goal=\"grief\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"goal-option-label\"><span class=\"goal-swatch\" style=\"--swatch:#9B8AB8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Grief</span></button>\n          <button class=\"goal-option\" type=\"button\" data-goal=\"depression\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"goal-option-label\"><span class=\"goal-swatch\" style=\"--swatch:#C49E34\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Low mood</span></button>\n          <button class=\"goal-option\" type=\"button\" data-goal=\"relationships\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"goal-option-label\"><span class=\"goal-swatch\" style=\"--swatch:#C87F7F\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Relationships</span></button>\n          <button class=\"goal-option\" type=\"button\" data-goal=\"career\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"goal-option-label\"><span class=\"goal-swatch\" style=\"--swatch:#409494\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Career</span></button>\n          <button class=\"goal-option\" type=\"button\" data-goal=\"trauma\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"goal-option-label\"><span class=\"goal-swatch\" style=\"--swatch:#B86C48\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Trauma</span></button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"goal-detail\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"><strong id=\"goal-detail-title\">Curious</strong><p id=\"goal-detail-copy\">No particular goal in mind? Start with a warm, unhurried space and see what comes up.</p></div>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"goal-continue\" type=\"button\" data-close-goals=\"\">Explore Ode →</button>\n      <button class=\"goal-skip\" type=\"button\" id=\"goal-skip\">I’ll choose later</button>\n      <p class=\"goal-disclaimer\">This choice stays in this browser. You choose your in-app goal separately.</p>\n    </div>\n  </dialog>\n  <section class=\"proof\" id=\"inside\" data-sc-act=\"pin\" data-sc-span=\"3.6\" aria-label=\"Ode app journey\">\n    <div class=\"proof-stage sc-stage\" data-sc-stage=\"\">\n      <div class=\"proof-shell\">\n        <div class=\"proof-top\"><span>Inside Ode · the journal journey</span><span>Scroll to follow a thought from reflection to pattern</span></div>\n        <div class=\"proof-beat\" data-sc-cue=\"0 .37 0 .24\">\n          <div class=\"proof-copy\"><span class=\"proof-step\">Reflect</span><h2>Hear your own words <em>back.</em></h2><p>After you record or write, Ode turns the moment into a journal entry and a grounded reflection. There is room to sit with it before doing anything else.</p></div>\n          <div class=\"proof-media\"><button class=\"proof-phone\" type=\"button\" data-open-screen=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-controls=\"screen-reader\" aria-label=\"Enlarge the Ode reflection screen\"><img src=\"/screenshots/approved/screen-1.jpg\" width=\"1080\" height=\"2400\" alt=\"Current Ode reflection screen with a sample journal entry and response\"></button><span class=\"proof-badge\">Sample reflection · tap to enlarge</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"proof-beat\" data-sc-cue=\".28 .72 .19 .19\">\n          <div class=\"proof-copy\"><span class=\"proof-step\">Follow up</span><h2>Stay with <em>the thought.</em></h2><p>Ask a follow-up when the first reflection opens something up. Each entry includes up to three follow-up exchanges with Ode.</p></div>\n          <div class=\"proof-media\"><button class=\"proof-phone\" type=\"button\" data-open-screen=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-controls=\"screen-reader\" aria-label=\"Enlarge the Ode follow-up screen\"><img src=\"/screenshots/approved/screen-2.jpg\" width=\"1080\" height=\"2400\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Current Ode follow-up screen with an example reflection and three remaining exchanges\"></button><span class=\"proof-badge\">Sample exchange · tap to enlarge</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"proof-beat\" data-sc-cue=\".63 1 .18 0\">\n          <div class=\"proof-copy\"><span class=\"proof-step\">Notice</span><h2>See what <em>keeps returning.</em></h2><p>Over time, emotion patterns and your Life Graph offer a wider view of what you chose to journal. The story stays yours to interpret.</p></div>\n          <div class=\"proof-media\"><button class=\"proof-phone\" type=\"button\" data-open-screen=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-controls=\"screen-reader\" aria-label=\"Enlarge the Ode patterns screen\"><img src=\"/screenshots/approved/screen-3.jpg\" width=\"1080\" height=\"2400\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Current Ode patterns screen showing emotion frequency and a life graph from example entries\"></button><span class=\"proof-badge\">Sample patterns · tap to enlarge</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"proof-progress\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Reflection</span><span>Follow-up</span><span>Patterns</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"section ownership\" id=\"privacy\" data-sc-act=\"flow\">\n    <div class=\"shell ownership-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"section-kicker\">Your words, your choice</p>\n        <h2>A record you can keep close.</h2>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Trust is built into what you can do with an entry, not hidden behind a promise. You choose whether a therapist sees a limited summary.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"privacy-list\" data-sc-in=\"\" data-sc-stagger=\"70\">\n        <div><span><strong>Your audio is removed after transcription.</strong><small>The journal keeps your words and reflection; the recording is deleted after processing.</small></span></div>\n        <div><span><strong>Sharing starts with you.</strong><small>You create a passcode protected link with an expiry when you want to involve a therapist.</small></span></div>\n        <div><span><strong>The therapist gets context, not your raw journal.</strong><small>Mood trends and summaries can support a session without transferring recordings or full transcripts.</small></span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"section depth\" id=\"more\" data-sc-act=\"flow\">\n    <div class=\"shell\">\n      <div class=\"depth-head\" data-sc-in=\"\"><div><h2>More ways to understand your story.</h2></div><p>The journal stays at the centre. These are optional paths when a moment calls for them.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"depth-grid\" data-sc-in=\"\" data-sc-stagger=\"65\">\n        <div class=\"depth-item\"><h3>Patterns over time</h3><p>See how feelings, people, and recurring themes move through your weeks.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"depth-item\"><h3>Dreams and life chapters</h3><p>Explore dreams through Jungian and traditional Vedic lenses, or revisit the stories that shaped a season.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"depth-item\"><h3>A longer conversation</h3><p>Choose a voice or text session with a Comforting, Rational, CBT-informed, or Mindful tone, informed by your journal history. AI assisted reflection is not clinical therapy.</p></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <details class=\"feature-details\"><summary>Explore the other ways to reflect</summary><div class=\"feature-details-body\"><p><strong>Relationship Map.</strong> Notice how the people you mention appear in your emotional patterns.</p><p><strong>Guided Journeys.</strong> Follow short, structured paths through grief, change, anxiety, and self-trust.</p><p><strong>Weekly and annual reviews.</strong> Revisit a wider view of your journal from Explore in the app.</p><p><strong>Five journal modes.</strong> Process a moment, vent, practise gratitude, think through a decision, or reflect on a dream.</p></div></details>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"therapist-band\" id=\"therapists\">\n    <div class=\"shell therapist-grid\" data-sc-in=\"\">\n      <div><p class=\"section-kicker\">For therapists</p><h2>Better session context, on your client's terms.</h2></div>\n      <div><p>Clients can share a time limited brief of mood trends and summaries. Their raw recordings and full journal entries stay private.</p><a class=\"dark-link\" href=\"/therapists\">Explore the therapist pathway ↗</a><br><a class=\"dark-link portal-link\" href=\"/login\">Already a therapist? Open the portal ↗</a></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"section plans\" id=\"plans\" data-sc-act=\"flow\">\n    <div class=\"shell\">\n      <div class=\"plans-head\" data-sc-in=\"\"><h2>Start with the journal. Go further when it helps.</h2><p>Clear limits and one-time passes. Prices below are for India (INR); purchases will be available in the iOS and Android apps when stores launch.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"plan-grid\" data-sc-in=\"\" data-sc-stagger=\"60\">\n        <div class=\"plan\"><span class=\"plan-name\">Free</span><h3>A place to begin.</h3><p class=\"price\">₹0 <small>/ month</small></p><p class=\"annual\">No pass needed.</p><ul><li>10 journal entries each month</li><li>Basic reflection and three follow-up turns</li><li>Seven-day mood chart</li></ul></div>\n        <div class=\"plan\"><span class=\"plan-name\">Ode Plus</span><h3>The complete journal.</h3><p class=\"price\">₹249 <small>/ 30-day pass</small></p><p class=\"annual\">Or ₹1,999 for a 365-day pass.</p><ul><li>Unlimited entries and Hindi/Hinglish support</li><li>All journal modes, including Dream Decoder</li><li>Life Graph, weekly and annual reviews</li><li>Streak freeze</li><li>Five therapist shares per month</li><li>PDF export and Apple Health sync</li></ul></div>\n        <div class=\"plan\"><span class=\"plan-name\">Ode Pro</span><h3>Journal plus AI sessions.</h3><p class=\"price\">₹499 <small>/ 30-day pass</small></p><p class=\"annual\">Or ₹4,499 for a 365-day pass.</p><ul><li>Everything in Plus</li><li>One AI-assisted voice or text session each month</li><li>Extra sessions at ₹299 each</li><li>Unlimited therapist shares and priority processing</li></ul></div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"plan-note\">Passes expire after 30 or 365 days and do not renew automatically. An AI-assisted session can also be bought without Pro for ₹499. AI sessions support reflection; they are not clinical therapy. Annual Pro includes one session per month while active.</p>\n      <details class=\"currency-details\"><summary>Prices outside India</summary><p>Plus: $5.99 / €5.99 for 30 days, or $39.99 / €39.99 for 365 days. Pro: $9.99 / €9.99 for 30 days, or $79.99 / €79.99 for 365 days. Standalone AI session: $7.99 / €7.99; extra Pro session: $4.99 / €4.99. Final local store prices are shown before purchase.</p></details>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section reviewed-faq\" id=\"questions\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-heading\">\n    <div class=\"shell faq-layout\">\n      <div><h2 id=\"faq-heading\">A few things you might be wondering.</h2><p class=\"faq-intro\">A little clarity before you begin.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"faq-questions\">\n        <details><summary>Can I type instead of recording?</summary><p>Yes. Choose Write journal and send your whole entry in one message. After the reflection, you can chat with Ode for up to three follow-up exchanges. Longer AI sessions also support voice or text.</p></details>\n        <details><summary>What makes the reflection personal?</summary><p>Ode uses your recent journal entries as context to notice recurring emotions, people, and themes. A reflection is an AI interpretation for you to consider, not a diagnosis.</p></details>\n        <details><summary>What happens to my recording and journal?</summary><p>Audio is deleted after processing. Your journal text and reflections are stored so you can return to them. You can delete entries or your account in the app; PDF export is included with Plus and Pro. Read our <a href=\"/privacy\">privacy policy</a> for data handling and the providers involved.</p></details>\n        <details><summary>Does Ode support Hindi and Hinglish?</summary><p>Hindi and Hinglish support is included with Plus and Pro. Ode detects the journal language and reflects in that language.</p></details>\n        <details><summary>What can my therapist see?</summary><p>Only the mood trends and summaries you choose to share through a passcode-protected, time-limited link. Raw recordings and full transcripts are excluded. Learn more about <a href=\"/therapists\">therapist sharing</a>.</p></details>\n        <details><summary>Is Ode therapy or emergency support?</summary><p>No. Ode provides AI-assisted reflection, not clinical care or emergency monitoring. Entries are screened for signs of distress and the app can show crisis resources. Automated screening can miss things; if you need urgent help, contact local emergency services.</p></details>\n        <details><summary>Will my pass renew automatically?</summary><p>No. Plus and Pro are one-time 30-day or 365-day passes, purchased in the app. They expire without an automatic renewal. See <a href=\"/pricing\">all plan details</a>.</p></details>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"section availability\" id=\"availability\"><span id=\"download\" class=\"anchor-alias\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    <div class=\"shell\">\n      \n      <h2>Your thoughts are worth hearing.</h2>\n      <p>Ode is preparing its iOS and Android store launch. Join the waitlist for an email when the app is ready.</p>\n      <div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button button-amber\" href=\"#waitlist\" data-open-waitlist=\"\">Join the waitlist <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"caption\">Just your email. No account needed.<br>View <a href=\"#plans\">plan details above ↑</a> or the <a href=\"/pricing\">full pricing details ↗</a>.<br>Store links will appear when available.</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<footer><div class=\"shell footer-grid\"><span>Ode · A private place to return to.</span><div class=\"footer-links\"><a href=\"#how\">How it works</a><a href=\"#plans\">Plans</a><a href=\"#questions\">Questions</a><a href=\"/therapists\">For therapists</a><a href=\"/teams\">For teams</a><a href=\"/about\">About</a><a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy</a><a href=\"/terms\">Terms</a><a href=\"mailto:talktoode.dev@gmail.com\">Support</a></div></div><div class=\"shell footer-note\">Ode supports reflection. It is not clinical therapy or an emergency service.</div></footer>\n<button class=\"goal-bubble\" type=\"button\" data-open-goals=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-controls=\"goal-dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\" hidden=\"\"><span>Your space · <span id=\"goal-bubble-name\">Curious</span></span></button>\n<dialog class=\"screen-reader\" id=\"screen-reader\" aria-labelledby=\"screen-reader-title\" data-fit=\"false\">\n  <div class=\"screen-reader-bar\"><p id=\"screen-reader-title\">App screen · scroll or swipe to read</p><div class=\"screen-reader-controls\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"screen-fit\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Fit width</button><button type=\"button\" id=\"screen-close\">Close</button></div></div>\n  <div class=\"screen-reader-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Enlarged screenshot, scroll to read\"><img id=\"screen-reader-image\" src=\"/screenshots/approved/screen-1.jpg\" width=\"1080\" height=\"2400\" alt=\"Ode sample reflection screen\"></div>\n</dialog>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
